# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  J.A.R.V.I.S — Release App Default Configuration
#  Seeded into ~/Library/Application Support/JARVIS/.env on first launch.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
JARVIS_FREE_ONLY=1
JARVIS_NO_GEMINI=1
JARVIS_APP_LAUNCH=1

# ── Language & Voice (Default: English; switchable in Login UI or with K key) ──
JARVIS_LANG=en
JARVIS_STT_LANG=en
JARVIS_TTS_LANG=en-GB
JARVIS_MAC_VOICE=Daniel
JARVIS_USER_NAME=Sir

# ── Ollama (https://ollama.com) ──
OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b-instruct
OLLAMA_STOCK_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b-instruct
OLLAMA_VISION_MODEL=moondream
OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=5m
OLLAMA_THINK=0
OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=4096
OLLAMA_NUM_PREDICT=1024
OLLAMA_TEMPERATURE=0.15
OLLAMA_TOP_P=0.9
OLLAMA_NUM_GPU=0

# Mac Metal + stability
JARVIS_MAIN_DEVICE=metal

# ── Performance Profile: eco | balanced | quality (P key in HUD) ──
JARVIS_PERF_PROFILE=balanced

# ── Speech & HUD (Balanced defaults) ──
JARVIS_STT_BACKEND=local
JARVIS_STT_PROCESS=0
JARVIS_WHISPER_BACKEND=faster
JARVIS_WHISPER_MODEL=base
JARVIS_WAKE_WHISPER_MODEL=base
JARVIS_WAKE_ENGINE=whisper
JARVIS_MAIN_LOOP_FPS=24
JARVIS_CAM_WIDTH=960
JARVIS_CAM_HEIGHT=540
JARVIS_HAND_COMPLEXITY=0
JARVIS_HANDS_ENABLED=0
JARVIS_VISION_ENABLED=1
JARVIS_FACE_INTERVAL=0.8

# ── Fast Boot & Low-Latency Pipeline ──
JARVIS_FAST_BOOT=1
JARVIS_SKIP_WARMUP=1
JARVIS_SKIP_BOOT_AUDIT=1
JARVIS_SKIP_OPENCLAW_BOOT=1
JARVIS_SKIP_AI_VERIFY=1
JARVIS_SKIP_TOOL_PROBE=1
JARVIS_SILENCE_TIMEOUT=1.2
JARVIS_PROCESS_DELAY=0.05
JARVIS_ACK_FIRST=0
JARVIS_SPEAK_WAIT_PROMPT=0
JARVIS_TIMING_LOG=0
JARVIS_DEBUG=0
JARVIS_DEVICE_LOCATION=1
JARVIS_ASK_LOCATION_ON_BOOT=0
JARVIS_MEMORY_ENABLED=1
JARVIS_LLM_BRAIN=1
JARVIS_STARTUP_FX_BRIEF=1
JARVIS_STARTUP_RESOURCE_VOICE=1
JARVIS_WATCHLIST_SIGNAL_ALERT=0
SUPPLY_CHAIN_AUTO_START=false

# ── Security (Release default: high — avoids halting first launch) ──
JARVIS_SECURITY_LEVEL=high
JARVIS_AUDIT_ENFORCE=warn

# Optional Cloud API Keys (Leave empty for 100% free local mode)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
